{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/791461-alternate-abyssals","id":791461,"title":"Alternate Abyssals","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Abyssal Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-12-23T03:24:47-08:00","id":791461,"title":"Alternate Abyssals","content":"I just noticed, reading through Exalted 3rd edition and explaining Abyssals to a friend, that 3rd edition does not actually make it explicit that they are corrupted Solars. They are certainly mockeries or copies of them, but unlike in 2nd edition, it isn't explicitly stated that they <i>are</i> Solars. So what are some other interesting takes on them? Can you see them being run in some way where they're <i>not</i> reincarnated Solars run through a Monstrance of Celestial Portion, but rather some other thing? If so, what explains their similarity to the Lawgivers?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2196-riklurt","name":"Riklurt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2196_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"70"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-23T03:33:47-08:00","id":791464,"title":"","content":"Oh man, I thought we were going to find an alternate to the &quot;life is so sad and graveyards are such romantic make-out spots&quot; thingie.<br /> <br /> Anyway, accepting that the Deathlords have somehow just gained control over the miracle of Exaltation without needing to divert Solars from their reincarnation, the Deathlords were (probably) still ghosts of Solars, and therefore carry echoes of their personalities and powers. If they try to Exalt humans in a way patterned after their own selves, the result will be surprisingly like Solars, aspected to death.<br /> <br /> ((The Neverborn, being dreaming, insane and also dead, are likely incapable of the necessary actions that would refine the Abyssal Exaltation to directly match their own Essence.))","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;From now on, instead of saying 'half-assed', I will use 'muled'. 'This is a muled job, Chris', I will say to my friend Chris. 'You need to do better, or your ass is grass. And not, like, metaphorical grass. There are weeds growing in there as we speak.'<br /> <br /> &quot;'The DEA is after you, man' I will tell him, in all seriousness.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8891-khantalas","name":"Khantalas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8891_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"899"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-23T03:41:05-08:00","id":791468,"title":"","content":"Creation has a mirror world. its blighted and encloaked in an apocalyptic storm of shadows but its still a mirror. Whatever principles that allow the Laws of diminshment and the functions of Exaltation to happen in creation also apply in the underworld. The neverborn (who are the greatest of things in the narrative of the underworld) sheered off parts of themselves, which is poetic because oblivion and whatnot, and the miracle that got set loose into the worlds also manifests as a shredded and dark mirror of the highest of the celestial champions. Solars and Abyssals are similar because those raised above mortals to the highest station will end up looking similar no matter where the power comes from.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Exalted: Princes of the Universe<br /> A Third Edition Exalted Podcast<br /> <b><u><a href=\"http://atrusilk.podbean.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://atrusilk.podbean.com/</a></u></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8769-tavelgorge","name":"TavelGorge","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8769_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"498"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}